  write:{task:"Write a 'Then and now' paragraph about yourself or your city (80–100 words).", model:"When I was a child, I used to live in Cerro Barón. I used to play football in the street with my neighbours every afternoon. I didn't use to like vegetables, but now I eat them every day. I used to be very shy, but now I'm more confident. Life has changed a lot, but I still love my neighbourhood.",
    frame:["When I was a child, I used to ___.","I didn't use to ___, but now ___.","I used to be ___, but now I'm ___.","Life has changed because ___."], check:["Uso used to en las 3 formas.","Contrasto pasado y presente.","Uso conectores (but, now, still)."]}
